      "end": 132,
      "text": "Sometime before 1960, a couple met for the first time in London at the BBC headquarters, where one of them was working at the time. ",
      "role": "selected"
    },
    {
      "ref": "q2",
      "start": 132,
      "end": 190,
      "text": "After this meeting, they went to have tea at Vienna Café. ",
      "role": "selected"
    },
    {
      "ref": "q3",
      "start": 190,
      "end": 272,
      "text": "The couple got married in a civil ceremony in Britain and had one child together. ",
      "role": "selected"
    },
    {
      "ref": "q4",
      "start": 272,
      "end": 344,
      "text": "When they were both over 60 years old, the couple had a church wedding. ",
      "role": "selected"
    },
    {
      "ref": "q5",
      "start": 344,
      "end": 393,
      "text": "These are the life events of a political leader. ",
